<title>SINGAPORE: SOCCER-LEBANON BEAT SINGAPORE IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEBANON BEAT SINGAPORE IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanon beat Singapore 2-1</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in a World Cup Asian zone group seven qualifier</p>
<p>on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Singapore - Steven Tan 58</p>
<p>Lebanon - Abdul Fattah Shehab 35, Babkin Melikian 79</p>
<p>Attendance: 14,500</p>
</text>
